11. UNIVERSAL NETWORK STATUS SYSTEM

Network indicators:

- ONLINE
- OFFLINE STORAGE ACTIVE

The system continuously informs users whether:

- Data is syncing successfully.
- Data is stored locally.
- Connectivity issues exist.



--------------------------------------------------


12. UNIVERSAL GPS STATUS SYSTEM

The PWA indicates:

- GPS Active.
- GPS Disabled.
- GPS Permission Required.
- GPS Signal Lost.



--------------------------------------------------


13. NOTIFICATION SYSTEM

