- Pickup assignments.
- Synchronization status.
- System alerts.



--------------------------------------------------


14. PERFORMANCE REQUIREMENTS

The PWA must be:

- Mobile optimized.
- Lightweight.
- Offline capable.
- Fast loading.
- Low bandwidth friendly.



--------------------------------------------------


15. BUSINESS RULES

- All operational workflows are mobile-first.
- Offline storage is mandatory.
- GPS awareness is mandatory.
- Network status visibility is mandatory.
- Role-based interfaces are mandatory.
- Large touch targets are mandatory.



